      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo malaykamo nguri ár, i awdiit gawaá doorí wa ale. Malaykamoowí dakose gár i kon a gweermór bohongwdá' aa tsaree', nee himuú muqsli oo taa tlaatlaáw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dayshamoodá' úr guri óh, kuduú aáng. Inós an kudá' tlaákw nee Neetlaangw. Guri tseék kureeri kumuú wák, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "guri kwaáhh baraá bohongwdá' aa tsaree'. Bohongwdá' guri tseék, guri dugnií qaás, as inós múk xoordu munguwa malé al/agín ay dír kureeridá' kumuú wák i boo/iya'. Ala aluuwo gár kuwa hariím a kun gweer har qoomár niinawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluudae kiteeraá aleesleemu ngiri ár, nee muu gaa i iwiít. Mukwí kwaa aleesleemuú i haniís oo sakwasleema kawa tleehhi. Nee slám qeereemo ngiri ár awa mukdá' taa sagetlaáq as Yesu kuwa lamabu'ún nee as axweesantá Mungú. Mukwí an kudá' makiito'oodá' gaa i tumbarara'atiiká, nee murslaaqatuuwós kudae, nee slám layaadá' kaa ya/anká gawaá gitsee/er'ine, laqaá tam baraá daber'ine. Mukwí iri slafíngwií kií/, tari waawuti'ii'ín dinkwa nee Kristo kureeri kumuú wák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee tu'uudá' naa meetiye' kaa slafisiiká ay dír kureeridá' kumuú wák ni waaraahhiya'. Gaarí an waasle/uú geera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé amohhoó' nee heé hhoohhoó' a kudá' dáw baraá waasle/uú geeraawo. Gawaá mukwihe gwa'arár tsár i /uuruú koondaaká. Ala inooín tari kaahamuusér Mungú nee ar Kristo. Nee slám inooín tari waawuti'ii'ín dinkwa nee inós kureeraá kumuú wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee kureeriiká' kumuú wák barnaxes naa faakiyé', Neetlaangw baldá' ku gweer baraá tseegamoorós tidae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós niri ti'iit as xoordu ngiwa al/agin, kudá' baraá bihhe tsiyahhaawo ar yaamií diriiá', kudá' ta babay Gogu nee Magogu. Xoorduuká' kiri burumbuur as slaqwara. Faaror'ín a adór hhasángw afaá tlawti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín tari waaraáhh ar baraá yaamu sleémeero, nee maraydaá múk hhohhó' oo Mungú kiri harweér, nee tam gixsadá' Mungú i sla'a'an. Ala asla niri gawaá doorí wa /ét, mukdá' guri /ák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Neetlaangw, kudá' muu gu al/agagiím, inós kuri kwaáhh baraá tlawtadá' asltá kiberíti iwa ohahiin. Diirí an didá' makiito'oodá' nee aarusmooduú lama sleeme i dirii'iya'. Inooín kiri slahh'eemiis tlaatla/aangw nee xweeraawo ay alhhe'eesay wasle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluudae kitángw aleesleemu oo úr oo /awaák nguri ár, nee kudá' aa gawaadá' i iwiit. Doori nee yaamu gitsee/aawós ngiri ilaguwiyé', tam dir'ín iri qwát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk aa qaatl nguri ár, oo urén nee oo ninakwe. Inooín taa sihhiít dír geeraá kitangwduú aleesleemu. Nee didaádae kitaabi'i kiri gweér. Kitaábuú hatlá' sleeme kuri gweér. Kitaábuuwí an kitaábuú Slafiingw. Nee mukdá' aa qaatl kuri sakwasleemuút ar har qoomoó tlehhemi'ii'ín ar adoodá' kara gooín baraá kitaabi'iidií alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlawi múk aa qaatl nguri dúx baraawós wa ale. Gwa'ara nee gi'i múk aa qaatl nguri baraaín wa duxuné'. Mukwí kuri sakwasleemuút umuúqo heewo ar har qoomoó tlehhemi'iiwós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwa'ara nee gi'iiwo kiri kwaáhh baraá tlawtadá' asla iwa ohahiin. Tlawtí asla iwa ohahiin an gwa'arár tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee umuúqo heewo oo umuuwós taa gooiniká baraá kitaábuuduú slafiingo, kuri kwaáhh baraá tlawtadá' asla iwa ohahiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
